{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 19:33:37.965313", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Description\\nThe network is an SDN star topology with one central switch (switch_0) and multiple edge switches (switch_1, switch_2, switch_3, switch_4). Hosts (host_1, host_2, host_3, host_4) are connected to edge switches, and all devices share a single access subnet (10.0.0.0/24). The management/control network (20.0.0.0/24) is used for OpenFlow communication with the SDN controller at 20.0.0.100.\\n\\n#### Reachability Test Results\\nPing tests were conducted between hosts to assess connectivity. Below are the results:\\n\\n1. **Host-to-Host Connectivity**:\\n   - **host_1 → host_3**: Successful (0% packet loss, RTT avg: 18.838 ms)\\n   - **host_1 → host_2**: Successful (0% packet loss, RTT avg: 20.261 ms)\\n   - **host_2 → host_3**: Successful (0% packet loss, RTT avg: 19.806 ms)\\n   - **host_3 → host_2**: Successful (0% packet loss, RTT avg: 20.233 ms)\\n   - **host_4 → host_3**: Successful (0% packet loss, RTT avg: 18.749 ms)\\n   - **host_4 → host_2**: Successful (0% packet loss, RTT avg: 18.464 ms)\\n\\n2. **Observations**:\\n   - All hosts are reachable from one another, indicating that basic connectivity is intact.\\n   - RTT values are within acceptable ranges, with no significant delays or anomalies observed.\\n   - No packet loss was detected in any of the tests, confirming stable communication between hosts.\\n\\n#### Preliminary Assessment\\nBased on the reachability tests, the network appears to be functioning correctly in terms of host-to-host communication. There are no immediate signs of connectivity issues or abnormal behavior in the access subnet (10.0.0.0/24).\\n\\n#### Next Steps\\nTo ensure comprehensive analysis, further investigation into the following areas may be warranted:\\n1. **SDN Controller Communication**:\\n   - Verify the OpenFlow connection between switches and the SDN controller (20.0.0.100).\\n2. **Switch Health**:\\n   - Check the status and configuration of the central switch (switch_0) and edge switches (switch_1, switch_2, switch_3, switch_4).\\n3. **Management Network**:\\n   - Confirm the stability and performance of the management/control network (20.0.0.0/24).\\n\\nThis report reflects the current state of the network based on the provided reachability data. Further diagnostics may be required to validate the health of the SDN controller and switches., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='446a05f3-7fd4-4a6e-8c32-53bc36844435'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
